				; MANUFACTURING BOOT TEST CODE ROUTINE							 
				:
				;       LOAD A BLOCK OF TEST CODE THROUGH THE KEYBOARD PORT FOR MANUFACTURING  :
				;       TESTS.								 :
				;       THIS ROUTINE WILL LOAD A TEST (MAX LENGTH,FAFFH) THROUGH THE KEYBOARD  :
